# Example openai.env
# Put your real key into app/src/main/assets/openai.env (DO NOT commit that file)
# Supported keys: OPENAI_API_KEY, OPENAI_KEY, API_KEY

# Example (uncomment and replace with your key):
OPENAI_API_KEY=sk-REPLACE_WITH_YOUR_REAL_KEY

# You can also quote the value:
# OPENAI_API_KEY="sk-REPLACE_WITH_YOUR_REAL_KEY"

# Optional: customize the OpenAI Vision prompt used when sending images.
# Prefs (stored via the app) take precedence. If not set there, the app will look
# for one of the keys below in this file and use the first match.
# Examples:
# OPENAI_PROMPT="Describe the contents of this image in clear, concise sentences. Include objects, actions, and any readable text."
# OPENAI_VISION_PROMPT="Please analyze this image and list detected objects and text."
# OPENAI_PROMPT_VISION="What is shown in this image? Provide a concise description."
